{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026HLOaV3MHNw1792658244.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞太區主要股市下挫。</p><p></p><p>日本股市跌穿63,000點關口，見近三個月低位。收市急挫逾1,700點，跌幅逾百分之2.6。半導體板塊受壓，鎧俠和東京電子下挫逾百分之6。</p><p></p><p>韓國股市曾經急挫逾百分之4，收市險守5,500點水平。兩大權重股SK海力士和三星電子，收市下挫約百分之4至5。</p><p></p><p>台灣股市以全日低位收市，跌至46,000點邊緣。</p><p></p><p>澳洲股市失守8,800點水平。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T16:02:30.462327+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T08:36:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:18:08.955212+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:58:03.389117+00:00","content_hash":"fcdf775d7ee56dbbb1657c343d2d71fdc1ae00acf5b2deb5338c0fd9198acf33","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T16:02:30.462327+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}